            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>  YoY CHANGE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>Æ  </run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC' fontsize='8'>Percentage points</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='15167' id='85' type-v2='text' w='21237' x='35533' y='14417'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>Æ   </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC' fontsize='10'>KEY FINDING</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>     The zero-MoM base-effect baseline recorded </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>   the lowest MAE (0.319) and outperformed the </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>   last-month YoY benchmark (ΔMAE: 0.146; 95% </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>   CI: 0.068–0.233). Random Forest variants were </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>   mostly statistically indistinguishable from the </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>   baseline. RF v1 recorded the lowest RMSE </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='PingFang TC'>   (0.499), largely driven by April 2026.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#18334b' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='18917' id='88' name='YoY decomposition' show-title='false' w='41644' x='1918' y='39250' />
        <zone h='18417' id='95' name='Actual vs Predicted' show-title='false' w='51959' x='45842' y='39417' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='17833' id='96' type-v2='text' w='40137' x='58625' y='13083'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18334b' fontname='PingFang TC' fontsize='11'>   RESEARCH NOTE - METHODOLOGY</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>      Data:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Monthly Thailand CPI, policy interest rate &amp; USD/THB exchange rate.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>      Models:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Random Forest variants and zero-MoM base-effect baseline.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>      Forecasting:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> 31-month walk-forward validation. Each prediction for month t uses only</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                         information available before month t&apos;s CPI is published (CPI through t−1;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                         policy-rate lags; USD/THB through month t).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>      Evaluation:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> MAE, RMSE and paired bootstrap confidence intervals </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                       (no autocorrelation adjustment).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>      Predictors:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Lagged CPI and policy-rate terms; USD/THB levels and changes, </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                       including the current-month average.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='15' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f7f6f2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='14417' id='105' name='Model Comparison' show-title='false' w='42474' x='1718' y='65750' />
        <zone h='6000' id='120' name='YoY decomposition' pane-specification-id='1' param='[federated.1q0exu81ccs3mz1dd4puh1rww4j6].[none:component:nk]' show-title='false' type-v2='color' w='11478' x='16838' y='40250' />
        <zone h='4750' id='121' name='YoY decomposition' pane-specification-id='2' param='[federated.1q0exu81ccs3mz1dd4puh1rww4j6].[:Measure Names]' show-title='false' type-v2='color' w='9589' x='28493' y='42000' />
        <zone h='11250' id='122' name='Actual vs Predicted' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.1fre69v0s8ob9o1bn8xd009xevnk].[none:series:nk]' show-title='false' type-v2='color' w='15876' x='72440' y='39083' />
        <zone h='13833' id='129' name='CI table' show-title='false' w='52509' x='46254' y='66500' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='19333' id='136' type-v2='text' w='50378' x='1168' y='80250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>Æ    </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18334b' fontname='PingFang TC' fontsize='11'>LIMITATIONS</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='PingFang TC'>Æ    </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>Small test sample:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Only 31 monthly test observations.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    Model selection:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> The MoM/base-effect framework was selected after examining test-period errors; the same test </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                            window was reused across experiments.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    RMSE sensitivity:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> RF v1&apos;s lower full-sample RMSE (0.499 vs. 0.589) is largely driven by April 2026. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                              Excluding this month, the baseline performs better (0.324 vs. 0.434).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    Statistical uncertainty:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Bootstrap confidence intervals do not account for autocorrelation and may be too narrow.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    Potential look-ahead:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Policy-rate lags were selected using full-sample correlations. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                                    Correlation does not imply causation.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    Decomposition:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> The MoM/base-effect split is an additive approximation, with a maximum residual </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                           of 0.13 percentage points.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    Brent crude:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Tested on an initial train/test split only; not included in walk-forward evaluation.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='15' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f7f6f2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='19083' id='137' type-v2='text' w='45911' x='52852' y='80250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18334b' fontname='PingFang TC' fontsize='11'>   DATA SOURCES</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>   Thailand CPI:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Trade Policy and Strategy Office (TPSO), Ministry of Commerce, accessed Nov 2026</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>   Policy rate decisions:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Bank of Thailand, accessed Nov 2026</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>   USD/THB exchange rate:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'> Bank of Thailand, accessed Nov 2026</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>   Brent crude (tested, not used in published results): </run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>U.S. Energy Information Administration, Nov 2026</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>                                                                             Analysis, calculations and charts are the author&apos;s own.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='15' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f7f6f2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7333' id='138' type-v2='text' w='40893' x='55395' y='90750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>       All data are sourced from publicly available official databases. Analysis, calculations and </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    interpretations are independently produced by the author and do not represent the official </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    views of the source institutions.</run>
