                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    SECTION 02 · PREDICTION PERFORMANCE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#18334b' fontname='PingFang TC' fontsize='11'>   Tracking Inflation: Actual Outcomes and Model Predictions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#496779' fontname='PingFang TC'>    A time-series comparison of observed headline inflation and predictions from alternative forecasting approaches.</run>
